de view, attaches reviews, and resolves PI Inbox items.\\n- node.remove hides, detaches, or prunes effective-view nodes without rewriting raw JSONL history.\\n\\nDelegation:\\n- The PI should keep strategy, node recording, and synthesis in the main context.\\n- Use lab.recruit and context.launch to prepare host-native sub-agent launch packages for bounded execution, survey, review, and implementation tasks.\", \"metadata\": {\"archive_dir\": \"evolution_archive\", \"artifact_dir\": \"artifacts\", \"exchange_dir\": \"agent_exchange\", \"lab_policy_file\": \"lab_policy.json\", \"recruitment_dir\": \"recruitment\", \"research_dir\": \"research_tree\", \"runtime\": \"x69z-auto-research\", \"schema_version\": \"0.1\", \"usage_dir\": \"usage\"}, \"ok\": true, \"reset\": false, \"root\": \"/work/targetmol/run/agent/project/.x69z\", \"warning\": \"\"}}"}],"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
